@startuml
title 用户一对一私信通讯图

' 设置样式：使用直角线，白色背景，使图表清晰
skinparam linestyle ortho
skinparam rectangle {
    BackgroundColor White
    BorderColor Black
}

' 1. 定义参与交互的对象
object ":UserA" as UserA
object ":UserB" as UserB
object ":MessageUI" as UI
object ":MessageController" as Ctrl
object ":PrivacyManager" as Privacy
object ":UserStatusChecker" as Auth
object ":MessageDB" as DB

' 2. 布局辅助 (使用 hidden 线条微调位置)
' 强制 Auth 在 Ctrl 上方，DB 在 Ctrl 下方
Auth -[hidden]down- Ctrl
Ctrl -[hidden]down- DB

' 3. 定义链接 (Links) 与 消息 (Messages)

' [左侧] UserA 与 UI 的交互：选择人、输入、看到发送结果
UserA -right- UI : 1: selectContact(receiverId) > \n 4: inputMessageContent(content) > \n 12: showMessageSent(messageId) <

' [上方] UI 直接调用隐私管理器 (在发送给 Controller 之前)
UI -up- Privacy : 2: checkPrivacySetting(senderId, receiverId) > \n 3: returnPrivacyResult(allow) <

' [左中] UI 提交给控制器
UI -right- Ctrl : 5: sendMessage(senderId, receiverId, content) >

' [中上] 控制器进行登录校验
Ctrl -up- Auth : 6: checkLoginStatus(senderId) > \n 7: returnLoginStatus(status) <

' [右侧] 控制器通知 UserB (推送通知)
' 注：步骤 13 通常由 UserB 的 UI 展示，但通讯图中为体现流程流向，常表示为数据流向接收者
Ctrl -right- UserB : 11: pushMessageNotification(receiverId, messageId) > \n 13: showReceivedMessage(message) >

' [下方] 控制器与数据库交互
Ctrl -down- DB : 8: saveMessageInfo(senderId, receiverId, content) > \n 10: returnSendResult(messageId) <

' [下方] 数据库自调用：标记未读
DB -right- DB : 9: markUnread(receiverId, messageId)

@enduml